# Grok 4.6 review

- Open Folder must be ainav-control-plane root.
- Model: Grok 4.6.
- Gate: `cd agent-governance && PYTHONPATH=. python3 tests/test_plane_major.py`
- Paste: docs/PASTE_GROK46_REVIEW.md between BEGIN and END.
- Include terminal output in the same chat.
- Job C only. Dual + fail-closed not waivable.
- Tickets from propose() only. Tagged digests only.
- Do not mark LIVE_PIN_OK, signed L1, or live SoR closed without evidence.
